"孙宏为南阳太守（按《孙氏谱》）","evidence":["chengguo-q-70a024465f721991a8e5"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-70a024465f721991a8e5","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-9b9349e0f8b6fec640ed","layer":"pei","quote":"按《孙氏谱》：“宏，为南阳太守。宏子楚，字子荆。”","attribution":"裴注·按《孙氏谱》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":538,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7eacfca9e082b4c31e80","start":3,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-761d7ab188f8179f9152","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-b67c5efcc3b4d1a3b290","layer":"original","quote":"及咸熙中，开建五等；以放、资著勋前朝，改封正，方城子，宏，离石子","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-a29f3a0bdd379948b118","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-e0d538a4c9d8de18da89","layer":"pei","quote":"资在邦邑，名出同类之右。乡人司空掾田豫、梁相宗艳，皆妒害之；而杨丰党附豫等，专为资构造谤端，怨隙甚重。资既不以为言，而终无恨意。豫等惭服，求释宿憾，结为婚姻。资谓之曰：‘吾无憾心，不知所释。此为卿自薄之，卿自厚之耳！’乃为长子宏娶其女。","attribution":"裴注·《资别传》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd527f858b45627ff07f","start":210,"end":328,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
